[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_GOV]
Shuffling of Servants

[en.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_GOV_desc]
§g“Do not conform to the pattern of this world, but be transformed by the renewing of your mind. Then you will be able to test and approve what Sombra’s will is — his good, pleasing and perfect will.”§!\nWe have a bureaucracy and a political system that is far more efficient than the corrupt old Crystal Empire: Now, he says, they listen, it’s that simple.\nIt’s time for those old-fashioned bureaucrats who still manage this country with old thinking to be replaced by more loyal servants.

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_GOV]
奴仆的洗牌

[zh.FOCUS_C15_SOMBRA_TERROR_GOV_desc]
§g“不要再按照这个世界的模式行事，而要靠着心意的更新而变化。这样，你们就能感受到什么是森布拉的意志 —— 他的美好、愉悦和完美的意志。”§!\n我们已经有着比那腐败的旧水晶帝国高效的多的官僚系统和政治系统了：他说，他们听，就这么简单。\n还抱有旧思维去管理这个国家的那些迂腐官僚们，是时候被更加忠诚的奴仆们取代了。

